+ * 60x600. After TB_SETROWS a change of width gives as many buttons per row
+ * as fit, keeping the groups. Wine's buttons are 16 pixels wide here and
+ * Windows' 23 (with no strings Windows does not apply the padding until
+ * TB_SETBUTTONSIZE), so at 60 pixels Wine fits 3 per row, Windows 2. */
